message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SL-ADS: Subjective-Logic Anomaly Detection System"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-aware anomaly detection pipeline for network telemetry. The
  pipeline combines Prophet-style forecasting and reconstruction-baseline
  residuals into Subjective-Logic opinions, fuses them with Weighted Belief
  Fusion, applies conflict-aware ageing, and calibrates decisions with
  EVT/FPR-targeted thresholds. An expert-template-driven qualifier attributes
  each detection to a cause family.
authors:
